  --> tests/code_run_at_once_beside_refuses_a_lambda_that_changes_a_capture.nika:9:54
   |
 9 |     compiler_tests::code_beside_each_at_once([1, 2], fn(v) { total = total + v })
   |                                                      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
