   = note: Each of those tasks would change `total` at the same time.
   = note: Code a body runs one call at a time may change what it captures; code it runs from tasks at once may not (Part I 8.1.2).
   = help: Return a value from the lambda and combine the results afterwards, or keep `total` in a `SharedMut` and change it through `update`.
